     1                          ; ============================================================
     2                          ; leftover_items.asm
     3                          ; Leftover/unused item data - DAGGER, MAGIC AXE, HELMET, and
     4                          ; other item names + numeric records that do NOT appear
     5                          ; anywhere in the live 476-line BASIC program. Not reachable
     6                          ; by any current code path - likely cut content from an
     7                          ; earlier build of the game.
     8                          ;
     9                          ; Kept intentionally (not required for a working build) as
    10                          ; historical reference and as a possible base for a future
    11                          ; "restore the cut items" enhancement.
    12                          ;
    13                          ; Source: decompressed image $6271-$646C (corrected boundary -
    14                          ; was $6269, which incorrectly included the last 8 bytes of the
    15                          ; real BASIC program; harmless in practice since both files were
    16                          ; extracted from the same source image with no gap between them,
    17                          ; but now labeled correctly - see include/README.md).
    18                          ; ============================================================
    19                          
    20                                  * = LEFTOVER_ITEMS_START   ; $6271
    21                          
    22                          leftover_items:
